# Crewline

This repository uses Crewline (mosip/mosip-labs, `crewline/`). Its context is in `.crewline/` (read `.crewline/README.md`
first); the repository's own AGENTS.md / CONTRIBUTING.md win where they are more specific.

For any change to this repository: before doing anything else, run `python .cursor/crewline.py rule` and follow the rule it
prints (the current Crewline workflow, with the path of the cached Crewline core). Run Crewline validators as
`python .cursor/crewline.py <command>`. Questions and read-only explanations need no task.

Hooks (`.cursor/hooks.json`) enforce the rails: git commit / push / `gh pr create` are denied until the task's gates pass,
and force-push, `--no-verify`, hard reset, stash, branch delete and PR merge are always denied. Do not work around a deny.
Off for one session: `CREWLINE=off`; for this clone: `.cursor/crewline.local.json` with `{"enabled": false}`.
